lines:
I wanted to go with Capt. Stern on
the ocean floor exploration.{be01}
But the sub’s too small for me.{be01}
If I squeezed in, there wouldn’t be
any room for the Captain...

楠木馆长：嗯？{0100:0}，你
拿的是……{be01}
那是探测器！这会在
我们的勘探中派上大
用场的。{be01}
{0100:0}，你愿意用你的探测
器换点东西吗？{be01}
比如，嗯，深海之牙
或者深海鳞片？

楠木馆长：{0100:0}！{be01}
我们终于造好破浪号
渡轮了！{be01}
多亏了你朋友哈奇老
人的帮忙，我们才能
这么快完工。{be01}
来坐船体验下短途航
行吧！

Archie: Fwahahaha...
I commiserate with you!{be01}
All that effort you spent following
me here all the way from Mt. Pyre.{be01}
But now...
No one can stop us! No one!{be01}
Or, will you follow us back to our
Hideout in Lilycove City?{be01}
Fwahahahaha...

Capt. Stern: Why...{be01}
Why would Team Aqua steal my
Submarine Explorer 1?{be01}
They can’t be after the slumbering
Pokémon at the bottom of the sea...{be01}
But even if I were to chase them,
I don’t stand a chance against them...

Capt. Stern: Oh, {0100:0}...{be01}
Okay... So Team Aqua left before you
could stop them...{be01}
Oh, no, don’t blame yourself.
You’re not responsible for this.{be01}
Trying to catch a submarine...
It’s impossible for most people.{be01}
You would need a Pokémon that knows
how to Dive...{be01}
Perhaps if you went out to
Mossdeep City...{be01}
A lot of divers live out there, so
someone might teach you...

Capt. Stern: Trying to catch a
submarine...  It’s impossible.{be01}
You would need a Pokémon that knows
how to Dive...{be01}
Perhaps if you went out to
Mossdeep City...{be01}
A lot of divers live out there, so
someone might teach you...

{0100:0} doesn’t have the Ticket...{be01}
I’m terribly sorry.{be01}
You must have a Ticket to board
the ferry.

Capt. Stern: Oh, {0100:0}! I heard you
became the Champion. Congratulations!{be01}
Our crew found this on the seafloor,
inside the hull of an old wreck.{be01}
It’s a sea map, faded by the years.
It shows an island that’s on no chart{be00}
I know of.{be01}
A Trainer like you should be the one
to find it. Please, take it!
